	<strings name="main_menu/settings_select/player_setup/player_profile_edit/video_settings/campaign_ai/soldier_character/help_strings">
		<string text=""/>
		<string text=""/>
		<string text="Each soldier his own nerve, aggression, skill and voice, drawn each fight. Hunters and the Flood as ever."/>
		<string text="How far soldiers differ from their kind's average. The averages stay where they are."/>
		<string text="How often a soldier has a quirk (a coward, a veteran, a duelist), and how plainly he shows it."/>
		<string text="Each soldier aims, reacts and paces his bursts his own way. No squad fires in one volley."/>
		<string text="Lose them and an Elite calls the search, Grunts go looking, Jackals watch the corner you left by."/>
		<string text="Soldiers hold fire when a friendly vehicle with anyone aboard, your Warthog, is in the way."/>
		<string text="Each soldier sees your grenade in his own time and scatters his own way. No squad dives as one."/>
		<string text="Your Warthog full? The rest take the other vehicles and follow you, each in his own time."/>
	</strings>
